        "semanticLevel": "detail",
        "content": {
          "kind": "html",
          "value": "<div style='container-type:inline-size;box-sizing:border-box;width:100%;height:100%;min-height:100%;overflow:hidden;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,sans-serif;padding:3.4cqw 4cqw;border-radius:5cqw;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2.4cqw'><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;gap:3cqw'><div style='width:9.5cqw;height:9.5cqw;border-radius:50%;background:conic-gradient(#1d4ed8 0 0%,#e2e8f0 0);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex:none'><div style='width:7.2cqw;height:7.2cqw;border-radius:50%;background:#ffffff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:2.7cqw;font-weight:600;color:#0f172a'>0/8</div></div><div style='flex:1;min-width:0'><div style='font-weight:600;font-size:4.6cqw;line-height:1.2;color:#0f172a'>Every canon template is in the current model</div><div style='font-size:3.2cqw;color:#64748b'>Michael</div></div><span style='display:inline-block;padding:.3cqw 2.4cqw;border-radius:2.4cqw;background:#eff6ff;color:#1d4ed8;border:1px solid #bfdbfe;font-weight:600;font-size:3.2cqw;line-height:1.4'>In progress</span></div><div style='border:1px solid #fecaca;background:#fef2f2;color:#b91c1c;border-radius:2.6cqw;padding:2cqw 2.8cqw;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:.8cqw;font-size:3.4cqw;line-height:1.3'><div style='font-weight:600'>Needs you</div><div style='display:flex;gap:2cqw'><span>?</span><span>Which templates are canon templates, which become primitives pages, and which stay as reference?</span></div><div style='display:flex;gap:2cqw'><span>?</span><span>Are the primitive starters (content, glyph, method, port and the rest) superseded by the primitives pages?</span></div><div style='display:flex;gap:2cqw'><span>?</span><span>Is the order right, with the Page Template first?</span></div></div><div style='display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:2cqw;flex:1;min-height:0;overflow:auto'><div style='background:#f8fafc;border-radius:2.6cqw;padding:2cqw;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1.6cqw;min-width:0'><div style='font-size:3cqw;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#64748b'>Next · 7</div><div style='border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:2cqw;padding:1.6cqw 2.4cqw;background:#ffffff;font-size:3.5cqw;line-height:1.25;color:#0f172a'>Draft #2: Write down what a canon template is</div><div style='border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:2cqw;padding:1.6cqw 2.4cqw;background:#ffffff;font-size:3.5cqw;line-height:1.25;color:#0f172a'>Rebuild the Page Template and its demos</div><div style='border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:2cqw;padding:1.6cqw 2.4cqw;background:#ffffff;font-size:3.5cqw;line-height:1.25;color:#0f172a'>Fold the plan template into the Task Template</div><div style='border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:2cqw;padding:1.6cqw 2.4cqw;background:#ffffff;font-size:3.5cqw;line-height:1.25;color:#0f172a'>Bring the thinking family into canon</div><div style='border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:2cqw;padding:1.6cqw 2.4cqw;background:#ffffff;font-size:3.5cqw;line-height:1.25;color:#0f172a'>Bring workboard, collection, public arrival and the article template into canon</div><div style='border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:2cqw;padding:1.6cqw 2.4cqw;background:#ffffff;font-size:3.5cqw;line-height:1.25;color:#0f172a'>The handle template, and custom handles</div><div style='border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:2cqw;padding:1.6cqw 2.4cqw;background:#ffffff;font-size:3.5cqw;line-height:1.25;color:#0f172a'>Convert canon to the view-shape rule and publish</div></div><div style='background:#f8fafc;border-radius:2.6cqw;padding:2cqw;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1.6cqw;min-width:0'><div style='font-size:3cqw;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#1d4ed8'>Doing · 1</div><div style='border:1px solid #bfdbfe;border-radius:2cqw;padding:1.6cqw 2.4cqw;background:#ffffff;font-size:3.5cqw;line-height:1.25;color:#0f172a'>Draft #1: Decide the keepers</div></div><div style='background:#f8fafc;border-radius:2.6cqw;padding:2cqw;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1.6cqw;min-width:0'><div style='font-size:3cqw;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#15803d'>Done</div></div></div><div style='display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:1cqw 3cqw;font-size:3cqw;color:#64748b'><span style='font-weight:600'>Done when</span><span style='white-space:nowrap'>○ Every template in canon is one the owner chose to keep, and is in the current model.</span><span style='white-space:nowrap'>○ A written standard says what a canon template is.</span><span style='white-space:nowrap'>○ The Page Template, the plan, the thinking family and the handle template are rebuilt to it.</span><span style='white-space:nowrap'>○ Canon is converted to the view-shape rule and published once.</span></div></div>"
        },
        "memo": "",
        "link": ""
      }
    },
